{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "Contoh berikut kembali dibuat **dengan format yang sama persis**. Studi kasus kali ini: alur singkat pemrosesan request pada Spring WebFlux menggunakan Mono dan Flux.\n\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": []}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["e3c8b9b2-0b5e-4a9f-9b6e-cc9f41f2aa10"]}
{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "1. **Request Masuk**\nClient memanggil endpoint `/users/{id}`.\nController WebFlux menerima request tanpa blocking thread.\n\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": []}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["e3c8b9b2-0b5e-4a9f-9b6e-cc9f41f2aa10"]}
{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "2. **Pemanggilan Repository**\nService memanggil `Mono.fromCallable()` untuk akses database blocking.\nEksekusi dialihkan ke `Schedulers.boundedElastic()`.\n\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": []}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["e3c8b9b2-0b5e-4a9f-9b6e-cc9f41f2aa10"]}
{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "3. **Transformasi Data**\nHasil `Mono<User>` diproses dengan `map()` atau `flatMap()`.\nDTO dibentuk tanpa blocking.\n\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": []}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["e3c8b9b2-0b5e-4a9f-9b6e-cc9f41f2aa10"]}
{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "4. **Response ke Client**\nMono dikembalikan ke WebFlux runtime.\nResponse dikirim saat data siap, tanpa menahan thread.\n\nDengan pola ini, aplikasi mampu menangani banyak request secara efisien.\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": [], "finish_reason": "STOP", "grounding_metadata": {"retrieval_queries": [], "grounding_chunks": [], "grounding_supports": [], "web_search_queries": []}}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 410, "output_tokens": 275, "total_tokens": 685}, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-91e2b0c7-6a6e-4e9b-9f7c-2a9b7a6d1e33", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["e3c8b9b2-0b5e-4a9f-9b6e-cc9f41f2aa10"]}
